Aim: Declare and display different types of variables.

Algorithm: Start; declare int, double, char and String variables; print them; stop.

Program:

class VariablesDemo {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        int age = 20;
        double mark = 89.5;
        char grade = 'A';
        String name = "Ravi";
        System.out.println("Name: " + name);
        System.out.println("Age: " + age);
        System.out.println("Mark: " + mark);
        System.out.println("Grade: " + grade);
    }
}

Result: Variables are displayed: Ravi, 20, 89.5 and A.

